/en/ratko-mladic-s-funeral-casts-shadow-over-bosnia-and-herzegovina-vote/a-79189319?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ratko Mladic’s funeral in Belgrade, attended by Serbian and Bosnian Serb leaders, has deepened regional tensions and could affect the upcoming election in Bosnia and Herzegovina.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>BSW and AfD – a political love-hate relationship in Germany</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bb46ad966d0a139c6458081749170a4e17cd13e2030cac28887347698d2af7a7</id><updated>2026-09-15T13:41:16Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T13:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bsw-and-afd-a-political-love-hate-relationship-in-germany/a-79185782--2f6a7962abcf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bsw-and-afd-a-political-love-hate-relationship-in-germany/a-79185782?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Sahra Wagenknecht Alliance (BSW) could help the Alternative for Germany (AfD) into power in Saxony-Anhalt. But the BSW is riddled with infighting</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Afghanistan's women: A national soccer team without a home</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:32163c461c626ac76768b82d6d9c95576fb92b37da655449c37d2d4ddd7ed01c</id><updated>2026-09-15T13:41:16Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T11:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/afghanistan-s-women-a-national-soccer-team-without-a-home/a-79139500--7cfb666b9c3a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/afghanistan-s-women-a-national-soccer-team-without-a-home/a-79139500?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Afghan women's national football team has finally been officially recognized by FIFA. Now the players want to make history both on and off the field.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>PISA 2025 results: Reading and math scores plummet worldwi